   "questionHtml": "הוכח שאם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span> הם וקטורים עצמיים המתאימים לערכים העצמיים השונים, אז כל צירוף ליניארי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\mathbf{v}+d\\mathbf{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span> (<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\neq0,\\ d\\neq0</annotation></semantics></math></span>) אינו וקטור עצמי של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span> הם וקטורים עצמיים המתאימים לערכים העצמיים השונים, אז<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{cases}A\\mathbf{v}=\\lambda_1\\mathbf{v}\\\\A\\mathbf{w}=\\lambda_2\\mathbf{w}\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>ולכן<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(c\\mathbf{v}+d\\mathbf{w})=c(A\\mathbf{v})+d(A\\mathbf{w})=c\\lambda_1\\mathbf{v}+d\\lambda_2\\mathbf{w}\\neq\\lambda(c\\mathbf{v}+d\\mathbf{w})</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>הערה: האי-שוויון נובע מאי-התלות. וקטורים עצמיים של ערכים עצמיים שונים בלתי תלויים, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\mathbf{v}+d\\mathbf{w}\\neq\\mathbf{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span> (כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c,d\\neq0</annotation></semantics></math></span>). אילו היה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\lambda_1\\mathbf{v}+d\\lambda_2\\mathbf{w}=\\lambda(c\\mathbf{v}+d\\mathbf{w})</annotation></semantics></math></span> אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(\\lambda_1-\\lambda)\\mathbf{v}+d(\\lambda_2-\\lambda)\\mathbf{w}=\\mathbf{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ומאי-התלות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=\\lambda_1</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=\\lambda_2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, בסתירה ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_1\\neq\\lambda_2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
