   "question": "הוכח ש-$T$ היא העתקה ליניארית.",
   "solution": "אם $p_1(x)=a_1+b_1x+c_1x^2+d_1x^3\\in\\mathbb{R}_3[x]$ ו-$p_2(x)=a_2+b_2x+c_2x^2+d_2x^3\\in\\mathbb{R}_3[x]$, אז\n$$T\\left(p_1(x)+p_2(x)\\right)=\\left(a_1-2c_1+d_1\\right)+\\left(a_2-2c_2+d_2\\right)+\\left(b_1+2c_1-a_1-d_1\\right)x^2+\\left(b_2+2c_2-a_2-d_2\\right)x^2+b_1x^3+b_2x^3=T\\left(p_1(x)\\right)+T\\left(p_2(x)\\right)$$\nוגם\n$$T\\left(kp_1(x)\\right)=k\\left(a-2c+d\\right)+k\\left(b+2c-a-d\\right)x^2+kbx^3=kT\\left(p_1(x)\\right)$$",
