   "solutionHtml": "הווקטורים הנורמליים הם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec n_1=(1,-2,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec n_2=(k,-1,k)</annotation></semantics></math></span>. המישורים מקבילים כאשר הנורמלים פרופורציוניים, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec n_2=\\mu\\vec n_1</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=\\mu,\\qquad -1=-2\\mu,\\qquad k=\\mu\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\mu=\\frac12,\\quad k=\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=\\frac12</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_2:\\ \\frac12x-y+\\frac12z-2=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ואחרי כפל ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_2:\\ x-2y+z-4=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>. האיברים החופשיים (<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-4</annotation></semantics></math></span>) שונים, ולכן המישורים מקבילים ושונים.<br>המרחק בין המישורים המקבילים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x-2y+z+5=0</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x-2y+z-4=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=\\frac{|5-(-4)|}{\\sqrt{1^2+(-2)^2+1^2}}=\\frac{9}{\\sqrt6}=\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>(בדיקה: הנקודה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-5,0,0)\\in\\pi_1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ומרחקה מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_2</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{|-5-0+0-4|}{\\sqrt6}=\\frac{9}{\\sqrt6}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.)",
