   "questionHtml": "האם הווקטור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\3\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math></span> שייך לתת מרחב <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V\\cap W</annotation></semantics></math></span>? האם הוא שייך לתת מרחב <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V+W</annotation></semantics></math></span>?",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V\\cap W</annotation></semantics></math></span>:</strong> לפי סעיף (ג) כל וקטור ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V\\cap W</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא מהצורה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(t,0,t)</annotation></semantics></math></span>. ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,3,2)</annotation></semantics></math></span> הרכיב השני <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\neq0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן הווקטור <strong>אינו</strong> שייך ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V\\cap W</annotation></semantics></math></span>. (גם ישירות: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x-z=1-2=-1\\neq2y=6</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כך שהוא אפילו לא ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span>.)<br><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V+W</annotation></semantics></math></span>:</strong> לפי סעיף (ב) <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V+W=\\mathbb{R}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן הווקטור <strong>שייך</strong> ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V+W</annotation></semantics></math></span>. למשל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,3,2)=\\frac73(0,1,1)+\\left(1,\\frac23,-\\frac13\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר הווקטור הראשון ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span> והשני ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span> (כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\left(-\\frac13\\right)=\\frac43=2\\cdot\\frac23</annotation></semantics></math></span>).",
