   "solution": "$$\\begin{pmatrix}0&1&7&8\\\\1&3&3&8\\\\-2&-5&1&-8\\end{pmatrix}\\xrightarrow{E_1A}\\begin{pmatrix}1&3&3&8\\\\0&1&7&8\\\\-2&-5&1&-8\\end{pmatrix}\\xrightarrow{E_2E_1A}\\begin{pmatrix}1&3&3&8\\\\0&1&7&8\\\\0&1&7&8\\end{pmatrix}\\xrightarrow{E_3E_2E_1A}\\begin{pmatrix}1&3&3&8\\\\0&1&7&8\\\\0&0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$$\n$$E_3=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\0&1&0\\\\0&-1&1\\end{pmatrix},\\ E_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\0&1&0\\\\2&0&1\\end{pmatrix},\\ E_1=\\begin{pmatrix}0&1&0\\\\1&0&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad E_3E_2E_1A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&3&3&8\\\\0&1&7&8\\\\0&0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}=R$$\n$$A=E_1^{-1}E_2^{-1}E_3^{-1}R\\ \\Leftarrow\\ E_1A=E_2^{-1}E_3^{-1}R\\ \\Leftarrow\\ E_2E_1A=E_3^{-1}R\\ \\Leftarrow\\ E_3E_2E_1A=R$$\nוהמטריצות $G=E_3^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\0&1&0\\\\0&1&1\\end{pmatrix},\\ F=E_2^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\0&1&0\\\\-2&0&1\\end{pmatrix},\\ E=E_1^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&1&0\\\\1&0&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$.",
