   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "דטרמיננטות",
   "questionHtml": "נניח ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span> מטריצות הפיכות המקיימות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CD^2=D^3C^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הוכיחו ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det(D)&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "מטריצות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C,D</annotation></semantics></math></span> הפיכות, פירושו של דבר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det C\\neq0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det D\\neq0</annotation></semantics></math></span>. נשתמש בעובדה זו ובתכונות של פעולת הדטרמיננטה על כפל מטריצות:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det\\left(CD^2\\right)=\\det\\left(D^3C^{-1}\\right)\\Rightarrow\\det(C)\\det\\left(D^2\\right)=\\det\\left(D^3\\right)\\det\\left(C^{-1}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det\\left(D^2\\right)=\\det(DD)=\\det(D)\\det(D)=(\\det(D))^2,\\qquad\\det\\left(D^3\\right)=\\det(DDD)=(\\det(D))^3,\\qquad\\det\\left(C^{-1}\\right)=1/\\det(C)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>לכן נקבל<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det(C)(\\det(D))^2=(\\det(D))^3\\frac{1}{\\det(C)}\\Rightarrow(\\det(C))^2(\\det(D))^2=(\\det(D))^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow0=(\\det(D))^2\\left(\\det(D)-(\\det(C))^2\\right)\\Rightarrow\\det(D)=(\\det(C))^2&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
