   "solution": "$E$ בסיס סטנדרטי של $\\mathbb{R}^2$. $\\left|\\begin{matrix}5&2\\\\17&7\\end{matrix}\\right|=1\\neq0$ אז $B=\\left(\\begin{pmatrix}5\\\\17\\end{pmatrix},\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\7\\end{pmatrix}\\right)$ בסיס של $\\mathbb{R}^2$. לכן $[I]_E^B=\\begin{pmatrix}5&2\\\\17&7\\end{pmatrix}$.\n$$F\\left(\\begin{pmatrix}a\\\\b\\end{pmatrix}\\right)=\\begin{pmatrix}a+b\\\\a-b\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow F\\left(\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\right)=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix},\\ F\\left(\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\right)=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow[F]_E^E=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\1&-1\\end{pmatrix}$$\n$$[F]_B^B=[I]_B^E[F]_E^E[I]_E^B=\\begin{pmatrix}5&2\\\\17&7\\end{pmatrix}^{-1}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\1&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}5&2\\\\17&7\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}7&-2\\\\-17&5\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}22&9\\\\-12&-5\\end{pmatrix}$$\n$$=\\begin{pmatrix}154+24&63+10\\\\-374-60&-153-25\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}178&73\\\\-434&-178\\end{pmatrix}$$",
