   "solution": "$$k+11t+t^2\\in\\mathrm{Im}\\,T\\ \\Leftrightarrow\\ \\begin{pmatrix}k\\\\11\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\in\\mathrm{Col}\\,A\\ \\Leftrightarrow\\ \\begin{pmatrix}k\\\\11\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=x_1\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}+x_2\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\3\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}$$\n$$\\left(\\begin{array}{cc|c}1&1&k\\\\1&3&11\\\\-1&1&1\\end{array}\\right)\\to\\left(\\begin{array}{cc|c}1&1&k\\\\0&2&11-k\\\\0&2&1+k\\end{array}\\right)\\to\\left(\\begin{array}{cc|c}1&1&k\\\\0&2&11-k\\\\0&0&-10+2k\\end{array}\\right)\\Rightarrow-10+2k=0\\Rightarrow k=5$$",
