   "solutionHtml": "נתון שמתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{cases}B\\vec v=\\lambda_1\\vec v\\\\ B\\vec w=\\lambda_2\\vec w\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span> כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_1\\neq\\lambda_2</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מכאן, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\neq0,\\ d\\neq0</annotation></semantics></math></span> ואם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(c\\vec v+d\\vec w)=c(B\\vec v)+d(B\\vec w)=c\\lambda_1\\vec v+d\\lambda_2\\vec w</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אז אין שום אפשרות להגיע לשוויון <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(c\\vec v+d\\vec w)=\\lambda(c\\vec v+d\\vec w)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
