   "solutionHtml": "את החיתוך <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U\\cap W</annotation></semantics></math></span> נקבל מהשוואת הצירופים הלינאריים:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a\\left(x^3+2\\right)+b\\left(x^2+1\\right)+cx=dx^2+e</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow\\ ax^3+x^2(b-d)+cx+(2a+b-e)=0\\ \\Rightarrow\\ a=0,\\ b=d,\\ c=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>לפיכך <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>dim</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dim(U\\cap W)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U\\cap W=\\mathrm{Sp}\\left\\{x^2+1\\right\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, וכן<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>dim</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>dim</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>dim</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>dim</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dim(U+W)=\\dim(U)+\\dim(W)-\\dim(U\\cap W)\\ \\Rightarrow\\ 4=3+2-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
