     "explainHtml": "מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a-1=5+a\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{a+4}{3}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span> נקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3a-18=-a(a+4)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^2+7a-18=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
