     "text": "$S_3$ מאונך ל-$S_1$ ול-$S_2$, ולכן $\\vec N_1,\\vec N_2$ מקבילים ל-$S_3$",
     "points": 3,
     "html": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_3</annotation></semantics></math></span> מאונך ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ול-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec N_1,\\vec N_2</annotation></semantics></math></span> מקבילים ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_3</annotation></semantics></math></span>"
