   "questionHtml": "נניח ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span> מטריצות הפיכות המקיימות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HD^2=D^3H^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הוכיחו ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det(D)&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נפעיל דטרמיננטה על שני האגפים ונשתמש ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det(XY)=\\det X\\cdot\\det Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> וב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det\\left(H^{-1}\\right)=\\frac{1}{\\det H}</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>D</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>D</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det H\\cdot(\\det D)^2=(\\det D)^3\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\det H}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>נכפיל ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det H</annotation></semantics></math></span> (שונה מאפס כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span> הפיכה):<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>H</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>D</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>D</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\det H)^2(\\det D)^2=(\\det D)^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span> הפיכה ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det D\\neq0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ומותר לחלק ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>D</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\det D)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>H</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det D=(\\det H)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det H</annotation></semantics></math></span> מספר ממשי שונה מאפס, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>H</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\det H)^2&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\det(D)&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
