   "questionHtml": "הוכיחו שאם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא ערך עצמי של מטריצה הפיכה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec u</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא וקטור עצמי שמתאים ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span> יהיה ערך עצמי של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם אותו הווקטור העצמי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec u</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "נתון <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\vec u=\\lambda\\vec u</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mn>0</mn><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec u\\neq\\vec 0</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda\\neq0</annotation></semantics></math></span>:</strong> אילו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, היה מתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mn>0</mn><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\vec u=\\vec 0</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mn>0</mn><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec u\\neq\\vec 0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר למערכת ההומוגנית <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mn>0</mn><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\vec x=\\vec 0</annotation></semantics></math></span> פתרון לא טריוויאלי, בסתירה להפיכות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>λ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac1\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span> מוגדר.<br>נכפיל את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\vec u=\\lambda\\vec u</annotation></semantics></math></span> משמאל ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>A</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>λ</mi></mfrac><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A^{-1}A\\vec u=\\lambda A^{-1}\\vec u\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\vec u=\\lambda A^{-1}\\vec u\\ \\Rightarrow\\ A^{-1}\\vec u=\\frac{1}{\\lambda}\\vec u</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>ומכיוון ש-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mn>0</mn><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec u\\neq\\vec 0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, הווקטור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec u</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא וקטור עצמי של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> השייך לערך העצמי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>λ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac1\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
